       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-BALKAN-TYPOLOGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-BALKAN-TYPOLOGY-PROOFS.
           05  WS-BALKAN-SPRACHBUND-INVAR  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CLITIC-DOUBLING-BIJECT   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ANAPHORIC-AGREEMENT-OK   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DEFINITENESS-POSTPOSED   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-UNIVERSAL-TYPOLOGY-SEAL  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-TYPOLOGY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-TYPOLOGY-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-TYPOLOGY-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-SPRACHBUND-AND-CLITICS.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-AGREEMENT-AND-DEFINITENESS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-TYPOLOGY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-SPRACHBUND-AND-CLITICS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BALKAN-SPRACHBUND-INVAR.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CLITIC-DOUBLING-BIJECT.
       2000-EVALUATE-AGREEMENT-AND-DEFINITENESS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ANAPHORIC-AGREEMENT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DEFINITENESS-POSTPOSED.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-TYPOLOGY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-BALKAN-SPRACHBUND-INVAR = 1 AND
              WS-CLITIC-DOUBLING-BIJECT = 1 AND
              WS-ANAPHORIC-AGREEMENT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DEFINITENESS-POSTPOSED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-UNIVERSAL-TYPOLOGY-SEAL
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-TYPOLOGY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-TYPOLOGY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-TYPOLOGY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-TYPOLOGY-CODE.
